# Tooling defaults

- Use `bun` for installs and scripts unless the project or user explicitly requires another runner.
- Do not default to `npm` or `pnpm` when `bun` is sufficient.
- Canonical patterns: `bun install`, `bun run test`, `bun run lint`, `bun run format`, `bun run build`.
